# 🎣 Phishing

## What is Phishing?

Phishing ek social engineering attack hai jisme attacker fake messages, emails ya websites ka use karke sensitive information churaane ki koshish karta hai.

### Goal

* Username
* Password
* OTP
* Credit Card Details
* Banking Information

---

# Types of Phishing

## 1️⃣ Email Phishing

### Definition

Email phishing sabse common phishing attack hai.

Attacker fake emails bhejta hai jo legitimate organizations jaise:

* Banks
* PayPal
* Amazon
* Microsoft
* Google

ke emails jaise dikhte hain.

### Example

Subject:

```text
Your Account Has Been Suspended
```

Email me fake login link diya hota hai.

Victim login karta hai aur credentials attacker ke paas chale jaate hain.

### Characteristics

* Mass attack
* Thousands of users ko ek saath target karta hai
* Generic message hota hai

---

## 2️⃣ Spear Phishing

### Definition

Spear phishing targeted phishing attack hota hai.

Attacker pehle victim ke baare me research karta hai aur phir personalized email bhejta hai.

### Example

Attacker LinkedIn se information collect karta hai:

```text
Name: Jay Sharma
Company: XYZ Ltd
Department: IT Support
```

Phir personalized email bhejta hai:

```text
Hi Jay,

Please review the attached IT policy document.
```

### Characteristics

* Specific individual target
* Personalized attack
* Success rate high hota hai

---

## 3️⃣ Whaling

### Definition

Whaling spear phishing ka advanced version hai.

Isme high-profile executives ko target kiya jata hai.

### Targets

* CEO
* CFO
* CTO
* Directors
* Senior Management

### Why Called Whaling?

> Bigger Fish = Bigger Target

### Example

Fake email:

```text
Urgent Wire Transfer Required
```

CEO ya CFO ko bheja jata hai company funds transfer karwane ke liye.

### Goal

* Financial Fraud
* Sensitive Data Theft
* Company Access

---

## 4️⃣ Smishing

### Definition

Smishing = SMS + Phishing

SMS messages ke through phishing attack karna.

### Example

```text
Your Bank Account Has Been Locked.

Click Here:
www.fake-bank.com
```

### Goal

* Credentials steal karna
* Malware install karwana
* Financial fraud

### Characteristics

* SMS based attack
* Mobile users ko target karta hai

---

## 5️⃣ Vishing

### Definition

Vishing = Voice + Phishing

Phone calls ke through scam karna.

### Example

Attacker call karta hai:

```text
Hello Sir,

Main bank se bol raha hoon.
Aapka account verify karna hai.
OTP bata dijiye.
```

Victim OTP share kar deta hai.

### Goal

* Banking Fraud
* Account Takeover
* Identity Theft

### Characteristics

* Voice call based attack
* Trust aur urgency create karta hai

---

## 6️⃣ Clone Phishing

### Definition

Clone phishing me attacker legitimate email ka exact copy (clone) bana deta hai.

Original email ki tarah hi:

* Same format
* Same logo
* Same design

Lekin malicious link ya attachment add kar deta hai.

### Example

Original Email:

```text
Monthly Report.pdf
```

Clone Email:

```text
Monthly Report Updated.pdf
```

Victim ko lagta hai ye legitimate email hai aur wo attachment open kar deta hai.

### Goal

* Malware Delivery
* Credential Theft
* Unauthorized Access

### Characteristics

* Original email ka clone
* Highly convincing attack
* Detect karna difficult hota hai

